  "prefLabel": "Bar 302.04 Independently Operating Booths Equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 302.04 Independently Operating Booths Equipment. A licensee wishing to obtain a shop license in accordance with RSA 313-A:19, II, to operate an independently owned booth shall apply for a license in accordance with Bar 301.09(b). The booth shall be located in a shop already licensed in accordance with RSA 313-A:19, I.\n\nSource. #5308, eff 1-16-92; ss by #6046-b, eff 6-1-95; ss and moved by #6577, eff 9-13-97 (from Bar 303.04); ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #8655, eff 6-9-06; ss by #10412-B, eff 9-19-13; ss by #13728, eff 10-20-23",
